  "labels": {
    "max": "Макс",
    "vadim": "Вадим"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside restaurant Claude Monet in the third episode. A stern prosecutor named Vadim confronts Max and demands to know who Vika is dating. Listen to their tense conversation in Russian first, and then we will break it down together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Слышь, малой, есть разговор.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Что вам нужно?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Тут у вас работает Вика.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Виктория Сергеевна.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "С кем она тут встречается?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Ну, почему молчим?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Почему я должен отвечать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Не хочешь отвечать здесь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Ответишь у меня в прокуратуре.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Ты меня понял?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Понял, всё понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Она ни с кем не встречается.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Ну, смотри у меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Надо срочно предупредить всех.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's examine this threatening interrogation step by step.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Слышь, малой, есть разговор.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listen, kid, I want to talk.' Cornered in the hall, the young cook finds himself facing a serious chat.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Что вам нужно?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you need?' Max warily asks what the older man wants from him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Тут у вас работает Вика.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vika works here with you.' A certain female employee quickly becomes the main subject of their conversation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Виктория Сергеевна.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Viktoria Sergeyevna.' Vadim clarifies exactly which woman he is talking about using her full formal name.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "С кем она тут встречается?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who is she seeing here?' Romantic engagements at the workplace are suddenly under intense scrutiny.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Ну, почему молчим?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, why are we silent?' Pressing for a response, the interrogator refuses to accept silence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Почему я должен отвечать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why should I answer?' Max defensively questions why he should be interrogated.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Не хочешь отвечать здесь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't want to answer here?' Intimidating questions flow freely when the current location is deemed suitable.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Ответишь у меня в прокуратуре.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You'll answer in my prosecutor's office.' Vadim threatens to relocate their chat to an official government building if necessary.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Ты меня понял?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you understand me?' Making sure his menacing implication has been fully grasped is key.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Понял, всё понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood, understood everything.' Hastily confirming he comprehends the threat, the cook backs down.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Она ни с кем не встречается.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is not seeing anyone.' Covering for his lover involves insisting she is completely single.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vadim",
      "t": "Ну, смотри у меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, you watch yourself.' Vadim issues a final warning before letting the matter drop.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Надо срочно предупредить всех.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Must urgently warn everyone.' Sounding the alarm about the suspicious investigator becomes the immediate priority. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
